Omission
- [N1] Omitted trace (input 0): i1:To start the process, -> i2:Course Packet Information Received should be sent, -> i3:followed by sending the Design to Faculty. -> i4:the Faculty will choose the design. -> i5:identify the content that requires copyright clearance -> i6:contact the publisher to obtain clearance. -> i7:If there is a need to "Contact Faculty to inform of denial and ask if new content should be added"
- [N2] Omitted trace (input 1): i1:To start the process, -> i2:Course Packet Information Received should be sent, -> i3:followed by sending the Design to Faculty. -> i4:the Faculty will choose the design. -> i5:identify the content that requires copyright clearance -> i6:contact the publisher to obtain clearance. -> i8:if the "Entire Course Packet Copyright Cleared", then the MPC should Calculate the Course Packet Cost. -> i9:add the Bookstore margin to determine the retail price. -> i10:If the Faculty needs to reconsider the course packet content to decrease the price